{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a4a8750f61226439","name":"Plant Surge","source":{"id":"source:reference-a4a8750f61226439","title":"Plant Surge","revision":20499,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:58:20Z","sha256":"79c9e14d1cdf948fcb142dc34b30838a12f2959f80be89d2eb0bf403ff0a6c2f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20499","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Plant%20Surge&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a4a8750f61226439","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You reach out with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to entreat the aid of plants, causing them to lash out at your opponents.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Time:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Targets:"]}," One creature within 12 squares of you, and within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". (There must be one or more plants adjacent to the target, or else this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," fails automatically.)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check. "]},"Compare the result of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," of the target. If your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check equals or exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},", the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," is reduced to 0 until the start of your next turn. A creature can escape (restoring its normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},") by making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," check as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", opposed by your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check result. (If the target cannot make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," checks, that target cannot escape.)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special: "]},"You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to impose a -10 penalty to the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," checks made to escape the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Plant Surge"]},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can maintain ",{"tag":"i","children":["Plant Surge"]}," from round to round, extending the normal duration. Maintaining the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Plant Surge"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", and you must make a new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check each round. If you take damage while maintaining ",{"tag":"i","children":["Plant Surge"]},", you must succeed on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check (DC = 15 + damage taken) to continue maintaining the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Plant Surge"]},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
